Rust crates (every wheel)
-------------------------

Every wheel contains one compiled extension module, built from fastbase91's
own crates and their Rust dependencies. The CycloneDX SBOM in the wheel's
.dist-info/sboms/ directory lists those dependencies and their licenses, all
of them permissive.

Bundled shared library (musllinux wheels only)
----------------------------------------------

The wheels for musl-based Linux (musllinux), such as Alpine, also carry a
copy of the GCC runtime library, which the Rust standard library links on
musl for stack unwinding. No other wheel contains it.

  Name:       libgcc_s (GCC runtime library)
  File:       fastbase91.libs/libgcc_s-*.so.1
  Source:     https://gcc.gnu.org/
  Copyright:  Free Software Foundation, Inc.
  License:    GPL-3.0-or-later WITH GCC-exception-3.1

The GCC Runtime Library Exception, version 3.1, permits distributing this
library together with fastbase91's compiled extension. License texts:

